Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 27.11.2021 passed in MVC.No.219/2020 by the Court of the Senior Civil Judge and Additional MACT, Sira, is modified;
- 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:14942 iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.25,05,000/- as against Rs.22,29,948/- along with interest @ 6% p.a. awarded by the tribunal;
iv) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid with interest at 6% per annum by respondent No.2-Insurance Company within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
v) All other terms and conditions as stipulated by the tribunal shall stand intact;
Sd/-
